cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
title: "AlpacaVision: Data Integrity in Vision-Language Auto-Labelling Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  An openly licensed alpaca (Vicugna pacos) detection benchmark from the Peruvian
  Altiplano (1460 images resolving to 742 distinct scenes), a compact YOLOv11n
  detector (mAP@0.5 = 0.698 +/- 0.024 over three seeds), a reproducible
  data-integrity methodology with a dihedral-invariant near-duplicate audit, and a
  controlled negative result on vision-language auto-labelled ocular anomaly
  classification.
